OL,3,AIran calls deaths at wedding
OL,4,Acelebration a 'war crime' as US denies
OL,5,Atargeting civilians
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran's foreign ministry spokesman
OL,8,FEsmaeil Baqaei says the killing of four
OL,9,Fpeople - including two children - at a
OL,10,Fwedding celebration was a "war crime"
OL,12,FThe Iranian Red Crescent says they were
OL,13,Fkilled when shrapnel from a US missile
OL,14,Fhit a house in southern Iran - Iranian
OL,15,Fmedia initially said five people had
OL,16,Fdied
OL,18,FThe US military says it is aware of the
OL,19,Freports but that it never targets
OL,20,Fcivilians, and was striking Iranian
OL,21,Ftargets in response to "recent
OL,22,Fattempted" Iranian attacks
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
