OL,3,AIran calls deaths at wedding
OL,4,Acelebration a 'war crime' as US denies
OL,5,Atargeting civilians
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Verify reports on what we know
OL,8,Fabout the incident
OL,10,FIn response to US strikes on Iran,
OL,11,FTehran launched missile and drone
OL,12,Fattacks at American targets across the
OL,13,FMiddle East on Wednesday - including in
OL,14,FKuwait, Jordan, Iraq and Bahrain
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Iran's Revolutionary Guard
OL,17,FCorps says two oil tankers hit mines
OL,18,Fwhile trying to cross the Strait of
OL,19,FHormuz
